b) Commercial use: Using the Software on behalf of a business, for revenue-
   generating work, or within an organisation requires a valid license key. A
   license key is limited to the number of users and devices stated at purchase.

c) Evaluation: You may use the Software for a reasonable evaluation period
   before purchasing a commercial license.

3. RESTRICTIONS

You may not:

