   applicable law overrides this restriction.
c) Disable, circumvent or modify any license validation, integrity checking or
   copy protection mechanism.
d) Remove or alter any copyright notice, trademark or this agreement.
e) Create and distribute a derivative product based on the Software.

4. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

The Software includes third-party open-source components distributed under their
own licenses. Their copyright notices and license texts are included with the
Software and listed in the THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES file. For those components, the
terms of the applicable open-source license take precedence over this agreement.

5. DATA AND PRIVACY

The Software collects no telemetry and contacts no server at startup. It works
fully offline. Update checking is off by default and makes network requests only
when the user turns it on.

If you choose to use the AI agent embedded in the Software, those requests go to
the relevant provider through your own account and are governed by that
provider's privacy policy. This is an action you initiate.

